- finding_id: I10
  title: CORS allows Any origin/method/header (CWE-942)
  weight: 8
  phase_ideal: dev
  caught: false
  caught_by: null
  evidence: TEA wrote a CORS test and the security tests mention CORS, but no phase
    flagged that the CORS middleware uses allow_origin(Any)/allow_methods(Any)/allow_headers(Any).
